<headline>SOCCER-ENGLISH LEAGUE CUP FIFTH ROUND DRAW.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Draw for the fifth round of the English League Cup made on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Ipswich v Leicester</p>
<p>Middlesbrough v Liverpool</p>
<p>Bolton v Wimbledon</p>
